+# Template provenance
+
+Prepared on 2026-09-29 for CVPR 2027 planning.
+
+- Official source: https://github.com/cvpr-org/author-kit
+- Upstream commit: `291758547e923160eb4d37079b7b9f0dfce82355`.
+- The current upstream template declares CVPR 2026; all upstream files are preserved byte for byte.
+- The CVPR 2027 Author Guidelines URL returned “Page not found” on the check date.
+- Project title identifies the intended conference; this source snapshot follows the current official kit.
+- This clean project preserves the complete template. The separate “MetisWAM4D real world” project contains the experiment information framework.
